    html: '<!doctype html>\n<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>产品叙事白板</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"><script src="app.js" defer></script></head><body><main><header><div><small>CREATIVE SYSTEMS / PRODUCT STUDY</small><h1>产品叙事白板</h1><p>用场景卡片串起产品故事。在画布上选中、绘制和移动元素，用颜色、文字和撤销不断调整叙事。</p></div><span class="badge">INTERACTIVE / LOCAL</span></header><section class="stage"><div class="bar"><div><b>✳ STORY / BOARD</b><span class="pill">产品发布 · Scene 01</span></div><div><button id="undo">↶ 撤销</button><button id="zoom-out">−</button><output id="zoom">100%</output><button id="zoom-in">＋</button></div></div><div class="whiteboard-layout"><aside class="tools" aria-label="白板工具"><button data-tool="select" aria-pressed="true">↖<span>选取</span></button><button data-tool="rect">□<span>卡片</span></button><button data-tool="ellipse">○<span>圆形</span></button><button data-tool="note">▧<span>便签</span></button></aside><div class="paper"><svg id="board" viewBox="0 0 900 540" aria-label="产品叙事绘图画布"><defs><pattern id="dots" width="22" height="22" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><circle cx="1" cy="1" r="1" fill="#d6d5c9"/></pattern></defs><rect width="900" height="540" fill="url(#dots)"/><g id="scene"></g></svg><span class="paper-mark">IDEAS ARE MEANT TO MOVE.</span></div></div><div class="properties"><div><small>SELECTION</small><b id="selection">发现时刻</b></div><label>卡片文字<input id="caption" maxlength="24" value="发现时刻"></label><label>填充颜色<select id="fill"><option value="#f5e9b6">暖黄</option><option value="#c7ddd1">薄荷</option><option value="#d8cce7">丁香</option><option value="#f6f4ec">纸白</option></select></label><button id="duplicate">复制元素</button><button id="delete">删除元素</button></div><div class="board-status"><span id="count">6 个元素</span><span id="board-hint">选择工具后点击空白处添加。选取模式可拖动元素。</span></div></section><footer>本地交互作品 · 演示状态仅在当前页面中保留 · 来源、独立重实现范围和完整许可见 NOTICE.txt</footer></main></body></html>',
